; The E0072 class: a cycle between two NOMINAL records whose recursive occurrence sits directly in a
; field, with no heap indirection anywhere on the cycle. Boxing the member is what rustc suggests and
; what this generator cannot do — it emits no `Box` in any type position and there is no directive
; that asks for one — so the boundary refuses the shape. Contrast `tests/corpus/recursive.cddl`,
; whose cycle passes through the same kind of nominal node but crosses a `Vec`, and compiles.
a = [b]
b = [a]
